SWIGGY: 

CEO OF INSTAMART AMITESH KUMAR JHA RESIGNS TO PURSUE OTHER OPPORTUNITIES; 

NANDITA SINHA APPOINTED AS NEW CEO, SHE HAS WORKED PREVIOUSLY WITH MYNTRA, FLIPKART, BRITANNIA AND HINDUSTAN UNILEVER

LODHA DEVELOPERS: 

CO TARGETS ₹10,000 CRORE FROM MUMBAI DATA CENTRE PARK LAND MONETISATION; 

PROCEEDS TO FUND 1 GW POWERED SHELL CAPACITY, WITH ANNUAL RENTAL INCOME EXPECTED TO EXCEED ₹2,000 CRORE BY FY32.
